{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-08-31-001", "date": "2026-08-31", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 36, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung Hosts #PlayGalaxy Cup World Final at Gamescom 2026", "content": "Samsung Electronics today announced that it hosted the #PlayGalaxy Cup World Final from Aug. 27-28, and that the final was held at the company’s booth as part of its larger exhibition at Gamescom 2026, held at Koelnmesse in Cologne, Germany, from Aug. 26-30. The #PlayGalaxy Cup is a global mobile gaming tournament designed to showcase […]", "sources": [{"name": "samsung_elec", "url": "https://news.samsung.com/global/samsung-hosts-playgalaxy-cup-world-final-at-gamescom-2026", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-31-002", "date": "2026-08-31", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 36, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "OLED material makers' results show a supply chain shifting to China, one layer at a time", "content": "<p>The OLED emissive materials market <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/ubi-research-oled-material-market-grew-7-2025-227-billion-will-slow-down-2026\">grew 7.1% in 2025 to $2.2 billion</a>, according to UBI Research. You would not guess it from the suppliers' financial results, though. <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/universal-display\">Universal Display</a>'s material sales fell from $365.4 million to $353.0 million over the same year, and then dropped 25% year-on-year in Q2 2026 to $66 mill", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/oled-material-makers-results-show-supply-chain-shifting-china-one-layer-time", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-31-003", "date": "2026-08-31", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 36, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth", "expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Gudeng sees double-digit advanced packaging growth from 2027", "content": "Demand for AI and high-performance computing (HPC) continues to drive semiconductor process development, with advanced nodes and advanced packaging entering a new cycle of capacity expansion. Gudeng chairman Bill Chiu said on August 31, 2026, that the company's advanced packaging business is expected to post double-digit revenue growth from 2027 as global demand continues to expand.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260831PD233/packaging-growth-2027-hpc-development.html", "type": "rss"}]}
